            <ArticleTitle>Condyloma acuminatum treated with human leukocyte interferon.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1247-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A patient with condyloma acuminatum is described who was treated successfully with human leukocyte interferon. An increase in body temperature, headache, nausea and myalgia proved to be the most serious side effects during treatment.</AbstractText>
